      "source": [
        "# Task_16\n",
        "\n",
        "Реализуйте метод градиентного спуска для данной функции с визуализацией."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "hJX0Mbaq37Ur"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "$$ z = \\frac{-5e^x}{(1+e^x)^2} - \\frac{10e^{y-5}}{(1+e^{y-5})^2} $$"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "6GNppaHU4Ou6"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "$$ z = f(x, y) $$\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x} = \\lim\\limits_{\\bigtriangleup x \\to 0} \\frac{f(x + \\bigtriangleup x, y) - f(x, y)}{\\bigtriangleup x}$$\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial y} = \\lim\\limits_{\\bigtriangleup y \\to 0} \\frac{f(x, y + \\bigtriangleup y) - f(x, y)}{\\bigtriangleup y}$$\n",
        "\n",
        "$$ \\bigtriangledown_{f(x, y)} = \\left(\\!\n",
        "    \\begin{array}{c}\n",
        "      \\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x} \\\\\n",
        "      \\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}\n",
        "    \\end{array}\n",
        "  \\!\\right)$$"
      ],
